{"id":"n25495-1-7","stage":5,"title":"걸려들다 · 落网","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25495-1-7-1","ko":"오늘따라 낚시가 너무 안 되는군.","zh":"今天钓鱼怎么这么不顺啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘따라","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；따라：强调某个时间、场合等与平常不同，如 오늘따라（偏偏今天）。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘따라","audio":"/audio/63be5b9d45dede0ea5d0.mp3"}},{"text":"낚시가","meaning":"钓鱼","explanation":"낚시：钓鱼；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"낚시","audio":"/audio/997b7b3d44815df9d683.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56098","senseId":"2","lemma":"낚시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"낚시가","audio":"/audio/7296bbda87e395f25596.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"되는군.","meaning":"顺利，不错","explanation":"되다：顺利，不错；는군：对新发现或刚得知的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"13","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되는군","audio":"/audio/e388dff8fae4cbad8368.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"997b7b3d44815df9","term":"낚시","zh":"钓鱼","audio":"/audio/997b7b3d44815df9d683.mp3","entryId":"56098","definition":"用钓具捕鱼。","pronunciation":["낙씨"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"顺利，不错","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"事情发展得很好。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/46cd3aaf5fc777884c77.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25495-1-7-2","ko":"기다리다 보면 작은 붕어라도 걸려들겠지.","zh":"再等等，应该能钓到条小鲫鱼吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"기다리다","meaning":"等，等待","explanation":"기다리다：等，等待；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62264","senseId":"1","lemma":"기다리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}},{"text":"보면","meaning":"看样子，看来","explanation":"보다：看样子，看来；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보면","audio":"/audio/35629c9db8f201235337.mp3"}},{"text":"작은","meaning":"小， 矮","explanation":"작다：小， 矮；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"작다","audio":"/audio/bc42f85bf5be37c92f7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69513","senseId":"1","lemma":"작다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"작은","audio":"/audio/ff7bc327debe9c5835f9.mp3"}},{"text":"붕어라도","meaning":"鲫鱼","explanation":"붕어：鲫鱼；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"붕어","audio":"/audio/10689af7cf1a8b3f4a68.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61047","senseId":"1","lemma":"붕어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"붕어라도","audio":"/audio/eb12bbbda3f16df38020.mp3"}},{"text":"걸려들겠지.","meaning":"落网，上钩","explanation":"걸려들다：落网，上钩；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"걸려들다","audio":"/audio/8d310d8fa056fd2387f0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25495","senseId":"1","lemma":"걸려들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸려들겠지","audio":"/audio/cacf6b88d4924b1c2819.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1f9765247406d52d","term":"기다리다","zh":"等，等待","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3","entryId":"62264","definition":"直到人、时机到来或某事完成为止，一直打发时间。","pronunciation":["기다리다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看样子，看来","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"由前面的话语所指的行动或状态来推算或表示即使不正确但知道。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"bc42f85bf5be37c9","term":"작다","zh":"小， 矮","audio":"/audio/bc42f85bf5be37c92f7c.mp3","entryId":"69513","definition":"长度、宽度、体积等少于其他或一般尺寸。","pronunciation":["작ː따"]},{"id":"10689af7cf1a8b3f","term":"붕어","zh":"鲫鱼","audio":"/audio/10689af7cf1a8b3f4a68.mp3","entryId":"61047","definition":"身体扁平，背部多呈黄褐色，鳞片较大的淡水鱼。","pronunciation":["붕ː어"]},{"id":"8d310d8fa056fd23","term":"걸려들다","zh":"落网，上钩","audio":"/audio/8d310d8fa056fd2387f0.mp3","entryId":"25495","definition":"被网或夹子等抓住，不能逃脱。","pronunciation":["걸려들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a7031f41468413ee0835.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.37,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=25495","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":162,"sequenceScore":3.1967,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["再等等，应该能钓到条小鲫鱼吧。","今天钓鱼怎么这么不顺啊。","橡胶怎么变得这么硬了呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天钓鱼怎么这么不顺啊。","橡胶怎么变得这么硬了呢？","再等等，应该能钓到条小鲫鱼吧。"],"answer":2}]}
